{"id": "|0EAE56C246D074047AE33AB278F24D1F", "source_en": "Each combat area is controlled by a Nexus Gate. ", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "تخضع كل منطقة قتال لبوابة النكسس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 14}}
{"id": "|7886AA614DA87643CFC1CEA20FAEB56D", "source_en": "Each combat area is controlled by a Nexus Gate. ", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "تخضع كل منطقة قتال لبوابة النكسس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 14}}
{"id": "|61590196491A5006D8954A938849A247", "source_en": "Each combat area is controlled by a Nexus Gate. \n\nEach gate has an objective that must be completed in order to progress.\n\nClear All Enemies from this Nexus to advance.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "تخضع كل منطقة قتال لبوابة النكسس. \n\nلكل بوابة هدف يجب إنجازه للمتابعة.\n\nالقضاء على جميع الأعداء في هذه البوابة للمتابعة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 14}}
{"id": "|9FA8C4C0488300FBAF34898039631214", "source_en": "Each mission has multiple paths that are selected randomly after each Nexus Gate. Each path has random enemy spawns and changing loot layouts. Replaying gives a new experience each time.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "تحتوي كل مهمة على مسارات متعددة يتم اختيارها عشوائياً بعد كل بوابة نكسس. لكل مسار ظهور أعداء عشوائي وتوزيعات غنائم متغيرة. إعادة اللعب تمنح تجربة جديدة في كل مرة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 14}}
{"id": "|34A7B90742CC98F2F6066688D07CE45F", "source_en": "Earn Angelic Grace that powers up Angel Ascension through parries, executions, and over time.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اكتسب النعمة الملائكية التي تمنح القوة للصعود الملائكي من خلال الصد، والإعدام، ومع مرور الوقت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 14}}
